  "description": "Jin-Yoo’s life is a living hell—he’s become a hermit due to an abusive father and a traumatic bullying experience. But just when he thinks life can’t get any worse, he is kidnapped by his high school classmate, Gyuh-Wool, who’s developed a twisted obsession over him. Jin-Yoo quickly learns that there is no escape… The only way to survive is to obey Gyuh-Wool’s orders.\n\n(Source: Lehzin US) \n\n*Note: Includes three extra chapters.*",
